0 MOOGLE MOOGLEKIT~
Use MOOGLE for the live menu, training and focus.
Moogle has an independent Genesis-native kit with supportive magic,
combat, defensive aspects and bounded crafting/restoration.
Use the live menu for the exact ability list and focus/currency requirements.
Its identity and state do not alias another class.
